# The keys that may sign a release tag of this project: one `ssh-ed25519 <base64>` line each, with
# no trailing comment, since a key's comment usually carries a name. Blank lines and whole-line
# comments like this one are skipped. Two keys may overlap for a rotation.
#
# This file holds no key until the project's owner supplies one. Until then the release preflight
# refuses every tag, and `landfall host install` and `host upgrade` refuse to run.
